: □ Yes    □ No    □ Unsure
</translate>
</div>
<br/>
<div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; border: 1px solid black; padding:5px">
<translate>
== What is hindering me? == <!--T:22-->
What did I not understand? Where am I unsure?
</translate><br/><br/><br/>
</div>
<br/>
<div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; border: 1px solid black; padding:5px">
== <translate><!--T:27-->
Talking with God: My next steps</translate> ==
{{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:31-->
Here you find suggestions for a conversation with God. Add everything that is on your heart and that you want to tell God. If you feel unsure about certain points, you can tell that to God honestly. Use the support of someone who has experience in talking with God.</translate>}}

<translate><!--T:29-->
God, which things in my life are not like You want them? Which sins do I need to turn away from?</translate><br/><br/><br/>
<translate><!--T:32-->
God, I thank You that I can talk with You. I realize that I didn’t live according to Your will. I’m sorry. Please forgive me that I  _______________ (name what God showed you).</translate>

<translate><!--T:33-->
Jesus, I thank You that You made a solution and that You died for me. I’m ready to change my life and get rid of everything You call sin. I want to live according to Your will.</translate>

<translate><!--T:34-->
Holy Spirit, please help me with that. Cleanse me and fill me.</translate>

{{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:35-->
If you can say all this from your heart then let someone explain to you how the start of this new life works (see “[[Baptism|Baptism]]” worksheet).</translate>}}
</div>

